{"id":"8c98695de8cf70aa","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-settheoretic-coded-syntax.md","title":"Totality and Correctness of Internal Membership Codes","display":"lem-settheoretic-coded-syntax — Totality and Correctness of Internal Membership Codes","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-settheoretic-coded-syntax","aliases":["89-lem-settheoretic-coded-syntax"],"display":"lem-settheoretic-coded-syntax — Totality and Correctness of Internal Membership Codes","depends_on":["[[89-df-settheoretic-coded-syntax]]","[[89-df-first-order-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-09","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-settheoretic-coded-syntax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-settheoretic-coded-syntax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-settheoretic-coded-syntax — Totality and Correctness of Internal Membership Codes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bf85e6f6750f6f5e\" href=\"?note=bf85e6f6750f6f5e\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-coded-syntax\">89-df-settheoretic-coded-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>元理论为 ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=g_\\in(A)\">\\(c=g_\\in(A)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_j\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)\">\\(v_j\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sat}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sat}\\)</span> 尚未用于本条。下列等式只涉及有限语法递归及已经给出的 ZF 公理模式；对象公式的数学外延在元理论中按其完全展开的集合论公式解释。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FVC}_\\in,\\mathsf{AVC}_\\in,\\mathsf{subc},m,\\mathsf{RenC}_\\in,\\mathsf{UclC}_\\in\">\\(\\mathsf{FVC}_\\in,\\mathsf{AVC}_\\in,\\mathsf{subc},m,\\mathsf{RenC}_\\in,\\mathsf{UclC}_\\in\\)</span> 为前条所给唯一图值。元层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_\\in\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_\\in\\)</span> 在下式以原始一阶子公式递归 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_S\\)</span> 直接展开。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_S\\)</span> 的递归条款固定任意一阶签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(C_0,F_0,a_F,P_0,a_P)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(C_0,F_0,a_F,P_0,a_P)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in P_0\">\\(R\\in P_0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^{a_P(R)}\">\\(\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^{a_P(R)}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf V\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf V\\)</span>。隶属语言等式取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L=\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_S(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_S(A)\\)</span> 是同一个递归函数的该实例。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}coded\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall c\\in\\omega\\ \\exists!\\langle D,F,A,C\\rangle\\ \\mathsf{SynRec}_\\in(c,D,F,A,C),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall c\\in\\omega\\left[\\mathsf{FC}^{\\mathrm{ob}}_\\in(c)\\leftrightarrow c\\in\\mathsf{FC}_\\in\\right],\\quad\n\\forall c\\in\\omega\\left[\\mathsf{SC}^{\\mathrm{ob}}_\\in(c)\\leftrightarrow c\\in\\mathsf{SC}_\\in\\right],\\\\\n\\mathsf{FVC}_\\in(g_\\in(A))&amp;=\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{AVC}_\\in(g_\\in(A))=\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\in\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_S(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t=u\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_S(R(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\{R(\\vec t)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\neg B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\neg B\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_S(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_S(B\\lor C)\\coloneqq\\{B\\lor C\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_S(B)\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_S(C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\forall x B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x B\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_S(B),\\\\\n\\mathsf{subc}(g_\\in(A))&amp;=g_\\in[\\operatorname{Sub}_S(A)],\\quad\nm(g_\\in(A))=1+\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{i\\mid v_i\\in\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{RenC}_\\in(c,i,j)&amp;=g_\\in(A[v_i:=v_j]),\\quad\n\\mathsf{UclC}_\\in(c)=g_\\in(\\mathrm{ucl}(A)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall c\\in\\omega\\left[\\mathsf{AxZF}^{\\mathrm{ob}}(c)\\leftrightarrow c\\in\\mathsf{AxCode}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}coded\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall c\\in\\omega\\ \\exists!\\langle D,F,A,C\\rangle\\ \\mathsf{SynRec}_\\in(c,D,F,A,C),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall c\\in\\omega\\left[\\mathsf{FC}^{\\mathrm{ob}}_\\in(c)\\leftrightarrow c\\in\\mathsf{FC}_\\in\\right],\\quad\n\\forall c\\in\\omega\\left[\\mathsf{SC}^{\\mathrm{ob}}_\\in(c)\\leftrightarrow c\\in\\mathsf{SC}_\\in\\right],\\\\\n\\mathsf{FVC}_\\in(g_\\in(A))&amp;=\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\},\\quad\n\\mathsf{AVC}_\\in(g_\\in(A))=\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\in\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_S(t=u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t=u\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_S(R(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\{R(\\vec t)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\neg B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\neg B\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_S(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_S(B\\lor C)\\coloneqq\\{B\\lor C\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_S(B)\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_S(C),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sub}_S(\\forall x B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x B\\}\\cup\\operatorname{Sub}_S(B),\\\\\n\\mathsf{subc}(g_\\in(A))&amp;=g_\\in[\\operatorname{Sub}_S(A)],\\quad\nm(g_\\in(A))=1+\\max(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{i\\mid v_i\\in\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{RenC}_\\in(c,i,j)&amp;=g_\\in(A[v_i:=v_j]),\\quad\n\\mathsf{UclC}_\\in(c)=g_\\in(\\mathrm{ucl}(A)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall c\\in\\omega\\left[\\mathsf{AxZF}^{\\mathrm{ob}}(c)\\leftrightarrow c\\in\\mathsf{AxCode}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自然数强归纳给合法性、变量集和子公式集递归的存在唯一性；再对公式结构归纳核对原 Gödel 编码、自由改名和闭合。最后逐一比较七个有限公理以及 Separation、Replacement 的相同变量条件。这里是形式化的数学引理陈述，不声称已附带证明助手可执行的证明项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-settheoretic-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"bf85e6f6750f6f5e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-settheoretic-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"c=g_\\in(A)","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"v_j\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{S