\\mathrm{ucl}(A)),\\\\\n&\\forall c\\in\\omega\\left[\\mathsf{AxZF}^{\\mathrm{ob}}(c)\\leftrightarrow c\\in\\mathsf{AxCode}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3052,"backlinks":[{"id":"178d313a2e1d8881","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-first-order-formula]] → [[89-df-formula-graph-expansion]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-graph-notation]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-language]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-coded-syntax]] → [[89-lem-settheoretic-coded-syntax]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-models]]。"}],"outgoing":["bf85e6f6750f6f5e","ec3012ebbfa291bf"]}